{"id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-normal.md","title":"GL Normal Lemma","display":"lem-gl-normal — GL Normal Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-normal","aliases":["89-lem-gl-normal"],"display":"lem-gl-normal — GL Normal Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-normal — GL Normal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\Box(A\\land B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n(\\Box A\\land\\Box B)\n\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\Box(A\\land B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n(\\Box A\\land\\Box B)\n\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL是正常模态逻辑</li>\n<li>在正常模态逻辑中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 对有限合取双向分配</li>\n<li>GL的正常性保证基本模态性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\Box(A\\land B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n(\\Box A\\land\\Box B)\n\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":630,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177"]}